The '''Stradavar Prime''' is the [[Prime]]d variant of the select-fire {{Weapon|Stradavar}}, sporting increased [[accuracy]], [[critical multiplier]], magazine size, and slightly higher damage on its full-auto mode, in addition to increased [[status chance]] and built-in [[punch through]] on its semi-auto mode but at some expense to [[fire rate]]. It was released alongside {{WF|Equinox Prime}} and {{Weapon|Tipedo Prime}}.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Impact}} and {{D|Puncture}} by a slight margin on its full-auto mode, and {{D|Slash}} damage on its semi-auto mode.
*Innate three {{Pol|Madurai}} polarities.

{{Advantages|
*Full-auto mode:
**High [[accuracy]] when shooting from the hip.
**Negligible [[recoil]].
*Semi-auto mode:
**Very high accuracy when aiming.
**Innate 1 meter [[punch through]].
}}

{{Disadvantages|
*Semi-auto mode consumes 2 rounds per shot.
}}

{{WeaponComparison|Stradavar}}
**Innate secondary [[punch through]] (1m vs. 0m)

